{"id": "3137901", "revid": "119536", "url": "https://ro.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3137901", "title": "Cincinnati Masters 2024 \u2013 Dublu masculin", "text": "Cincinnati Masters 2024 \u2013 Dublu masculin a avut loc \u00een a doua jum\u0103tate a lunii august 2024. Dou\u0103zeci \u0219i opt de perechi de juc\u0103tori s-au \u00eenscris \u00een competi\u021bia de dublu a turneului de tenis de la Mason, Ohio, Statele Unite, pe terenuri cu suprafa\u021b\u0103 dur\u0103, \u00een exterior. M\u00e1ximo Gonz\u00e1lez \u0219i Andr\u00e9s Molteni au fost campionii \u00een exerci\u021biu, dar au pierdut \u00een prima rund\u0103 \u00een fa\u021ba lui Hugo Nys \u0219i Jan Zieli\u0144ski.\nMarcelo Ar\u00e9valo \u0219i Mate Pavi\u0107 au c\u00e2\u0219tigat titlul la dublu masculin la Cincinnati Masters 2024, \u00eenving\u00e2ndu-i \u00een final\u0103 pe Mackenzie McDonald \u0219i Alex Michelsen, scor 6\u20132, 6\u20134.\nMarcel Granollers \u0219i Horacio Zeballos \u0219i-au p\u0103strat locul 1 ATP la dublu, dup\u0103 ce Matthew Ebden a pierdut \u00een runda a doua.\nCapi de serie.\nPrimele patru perechi intr\u0103 direct \u00een runda a doua. "}
