{"id": "3138109", "revid": "41997", "url": "https://ro.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3138109", "title": "Antun Vran\u010di\u0107", "text": "Antun Vran\u010di\u0107, latinizat \"Antonius Verantius\", maghiarizat \"Antal Verancsics\", () a fost un cardinal croat, primat (\u00eent\u00e2ist\u0103t\u0103tor) al Bisericii Catolice din Ungaria, calitate \u00een care a \u00eentreprins mai multe demersuri diplomatice.\nStudiile \u0219i \u00eenceputul carierei.\nA studiat la Padova, Viena \u0219i Cracovia. La v\u00e2rsta de 26 de ani a devenit secretar al principelui Ioan Z\u00e1polya al Transilvaniei."}
